          "id": "4d880d6a4a37b7d28a4259dfdbceea4a8db07eb0",
          "message": "ci: coalesce main benchmarks with bounded dashboard publishing (#6069)\n\n* ci: coalesce superseded main benchmarks\n\n* fix(ci): fail safe on future benchmark events\n\n* docs(ci): describe benchmark coalescing and manual writers accurately\n\nRemove contradictory no-cancellation and every-main-measurement claims.\nDocument that isolated runs do not serialize the unchanged manual-main\npublishers. Executable workflow policy is unchanged by this correction.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6 Astra <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* ci(bench): recover verified dashboard publication collisions\n\nRebuild the asset-only commit after an exact non-fast-forward rejection\nand a verified ancestor-to-new-tip advance, with at most three pushes.\nKeep manual-main publishing and stop on other errors or ambiguous changes.\n\nExercise the actual workflow shell against local Git interleavings and\ncalibrate recovery, classification, ancestry, bound and rebuilt-tip guards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6 Astra <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* test(ci): run dashboard publication races in CI\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6 Astra <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OpenAI GPT-6 Astra <noreply@openai.com>",
